// Composed in Copilot's chat (Claude Sonnet 5.5), 2026-11-10
// Asked: Write a pop song in which Zundamon and Metan cheerfully introduce themselves, trading lines.
// The AI: A bright pop song in B-flat major at 128. Zundamon and Metan introduce themselves in turn, two bars each, and sing the chorus together ("jikoshoukai hajimaru yo" - the introductions begin). The last chorus repeats its last line to lift the ending.

octave relative
pitch concert

title "ずんだもんとめたんの自己紹介"      // "Zundamon and Metan Introduce Themselves"
tempo 128
time 4/4
key bes major

